  "question": {
    "text": "If the number of terms in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>28</mn></math>, then the sum of the coefficients of all the terms in this expansion is",
    "image": null
  },
